{"pageid":3410,"title":"Skeleton","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Skeleton</span>","revid":20071,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-Character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Skeleton</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Skeleton.png/revision/latest?cb=20241017151309\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Skeleton\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Skeleton.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241017151309\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Skeleton.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241017151309 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Skeleton.png/revision/latest?cb=20241017151309 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Skeleton\" width=\"270\" height=\"309\" data-image-key=\"Skeleton.png\" data-image-name=\"Skeleton.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">Skeleton in-game</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"appearsin\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Appears in</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Acidlands or Blood Moon</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\nThe <b>Skeleton</b> is an enemy appearing during a <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">Blood Moon</a> during the Halloween 2024 event. When killed, it drops 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, and has a 20-40% chance to drop a <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a>. There is also a chance for it to spawn with a <a href=\"/wiki/Linked_Sword\" title=\"Linked Sword\">Linked Sword</a> in its hand, dropping it with an 90% chance after death.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Skeleton</b> can spawn in the center of the Farlands (near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>), the Taiga (behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's Autologistics</a>) and in the Savannah.\n</p><p>\nThe <b>Skeleton</b> can also spawn very commonly in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> biome. They have a chance to spawn holding a <a href=\"/wiki/Dragonbone\" title=\"Dragonbone\">Dragonbone</a> sword, which can be dropped. The Skeleton has 3 variants - <b>Skeleton</b> - <b>Skeleton Knight</b> - <b>Skeleton Bomber</b> </p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 183px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e2/SkeletonMODEL.webp/revision/latest?cb=20250709042011\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The skeleton model that is used in Oaklands\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e2/SkeletonMODEL.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/183?cb=20250709042011\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"183\" height=\"183\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"SkeletonMODEL.webp\" data-image-key=\"SkeletonMODEL.webp\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:SkeletonMODEL.webp\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The skeleton model that is used in Oaklands</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached ti